I played this game in the early 80's. Until it got to be to easy to
win.  OLD HACK SPOILERS FOLLOW:

























The Amulet of Yendor in hack was usually located on Level 26.  It was always
a maze level and the Amulet was always located under a boulder. 

The best way to get the Amulet was to use a potion of object detection.
Note the " and then see which boulder it was under.  To get it you had
to dig from the wall outside the boulder, then push the boulder out of
the way and get the amulet.  
